# Git Commits

## Co-authored-by

- **Never** add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` or any Cursor-related co-author trailer to commit messages
- Do not append co-author lines unless the user explicitly requests them
- When creating commits, use only the commit message body the user expects — no extra trailers

## General

- Only create commits when the user asks
- Follow existing commit message style (concise subject, optional body explaining why)
- Do not push unless the user asks
